//   15 rows, approximately 0.86 in spacing, 23 total 3/32-in holes
//   alternating 2-hole / 1-hole rows (8 double + 7 single)
//   holes face upward toward the lower Rushton
//   sparger entry azimuth 280 deg relative to the physical baffles
//
// Model choices:
//   - full solid tube and 3/32-in holes are NOT resolved
//   - each physical row is represented by a non-overlapping rotated box
//     extending from the top of the 1-in tube upward 4 in and 3 in wide
//   - OpenFOAM rotatedBoxToCell requires the (i,j,k) vertex ordering to form
//     a right-handed hex; k is oriented accordingly so face normals point out
//   - row source flow is prescribed independently in constant/fvModels
